cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper."
title: "Code and data for: Distinct activation mechanisms underlie ligand efficacy at a GPCR"
abstract: >-
  Code and input data reproducing every figure in a deep mutational pharmacology
  study of the human mu-opioid receptor (OPRM1), in which approximately 400,000
  measurements of variant effects on signalling and surface expression were
  collected across 15 opioid ligands, including concentration-response scans for
  morphine, fentanyl and DAMGO.
type: dataset
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/matthewkarlhoward/HaloTag-MOR_DMS_analysis"
keywords:
  - deep mutational scanning
  - GPCR
  - mu-opioid receptor
  - OPRM1
  - allostery
  - ligand efficacy
  - opioids
